('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_your_cr', 'Create a System for Your Critical Tasks', 'Critical tasks should be tasks that absolutely need to happen the day they''re due. Create a system around the order you get started and put this task at the beginning.', 'form', 131, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_your_ti', 'Create a System for Your Time Blocked Tasks', 'Like Critical Tasks, time-block other tasks you may batch — ordering home warranties is a great example.', 'form', 132, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_sending', 'Create a System for Sending Task Triggers', 'There are 2 ways to send emails from tasks: complete the task then send the email, OR inspect and send, then complete. Choose one way and make sure your team is trained.', 'form', 133, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_taking_', 'Create a System for Taking Notes', 'There are several ways to take notes, but it''d be beneficial to have one consistent way for your team.', 'form', 134, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_the_pri', 'Create a System for the Priority Features', 'This feature puts your transaction data at the forefront and just a few clicks away — create a system with your team around using it.', 'form', 135, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_adding_', 'Create a System for Adding Contacts', 'Keep contact info consistent — e.g. for Title Reps, add their phone numbers to the "Phone" contact box instead of "Cell Phone" so information isn''t missing in email templates.', 'form', 136, false, 'client', null),
('custom', 'Setup Launch', 'TM Systems & Processes', 'tm_systems_processes_create_a_system_for_new_age', 'Create a System for New Agent Contracts', 'We recommend creating an external intake form for agents to submit info missing from the contract or their platforms — e.g. client contact info, referral status, whether the client is in town, whether inspection is scheduled. Think about what you chase agents for mid-transaction that could''ve been answered ahead of time.', 'form', 137, false, 'client', null);
